@* Two-way @bind over a text input on the oninput event. Setting the input's value and dispatching a real
   'input' Event (now constructible via SpawnJS 1.1.8) drives the renderer's change/input handling, which
   reads HTMLInputElement.Value and binds it back into _text - the echo span reflecting it proves it. *@
<div data-textbind>
    <input type="text" data-text @bind="_text" @bind:event="oninput" />
    <span data-echo>@_text</span>
</div>

@code {
    string _text = "";
}
